      'You see that steering means a standard held from outside the work, which is what a plumbline is, "Behold, I will set a plumbline in the midst of my people Israel" (Amos 7:8), and what a dashboard built from the project’s own optimism is not.',
      'You learn to read a thin source honestly: the letter was a one-sentence teaser, we did not read the full article, and nothing was invented to fill the gap, which is the same discipline a project status report owes you.',
